<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Choose version - Omar Nino</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<style>
html,body{margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;height:100%;font-family:Consolas, monospace;background:#000;overflow:hidden}
body{
 background: url('luffy.jpg') center/cover no-repeat fixed;
}
#overlay{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.65);z-index:1}
#wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:30px;box-sizing:border-box;color:#fff}
h1{color:#00aaff;font-size:36px;margin:0 0 10px 0;text-shadow:0 0 10px #000}
.sub{color:#ccc;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:40px}
.section{margin-bottom:30px}
.label{color:#888;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:15px;letter-spacing:2px}
.vers{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.card{
 width:280px;
 background:rgba(10,20,40,0.85);
 border:1px solid #1a3a5a;
 border-left:3px solid #00aaff;
 padding:15px;
 cursor:pointer;
 transition:0.2s;
}
.card:hover{border-color:gold;transform:translateY(-3px);background:rgba(20,30,60,0.95)}
.card .title{color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px}
.card .desc{color:#7aa0c0;font-size:12px;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.4}
.card .ver{color:gold;font-size:11px;margin-top:10px}
#shop{position:fixed;right:15px;bottom:15px;z-index:3;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.7);color:gold;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid gold}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="overlay"></div>
<div id="wrap">
<h1>Choose version</h1>
<div class="sub">Select the optimal version to cache and use with the PS4 FW 9.xx host:</div>

<div class="section">
<div class="label">AVAILABLE VERSIONS</div>
<div class="vers">
<a class="card" href="index.html">
<div class="title">GoldHEN v2.4b18.12 - Latest</div>
<div class="desc">Latest stability improvements and bug fixes. Use for better compatibility. Recommended for most users.</div>
<div class="ver">GOLDHEN: v2.4b18.12</div>
</a>

<a class="card" href="index.html?stable">
<div class="title">GoldHEN v2.4b18 - Stable</div>
<div class="desc">Stable release focused on proven stability. Use if you encounter issues with latest version.</div>
<div class="ver">GOLDHEN: v2.4b18</div>
</a>
</div>
</div>

</div>
<div id="shop">صالة عمر نينو - 07701690121</div>
</body>
</html>
